@startuml
!include includes/report-style.iuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
hide footbox

actor "Sinh viên" as Student
participant "React task page" as Web
participant "Go API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
database "Object storage" as Store
actor "Giảng viên / quản trị" as Teacher

Student -> Web : Submit work
Web -> API : Create submission
API -> DB : Lock project; validate; insert pending

Student -> Web : Attach evidence
Web -> API : Upload support
API -> DB : Prevalidate lifecycle, access, target
API -> Store : Store private object
API -> DB : Recheck and insert metadata
DB -> API : Trigger checks target

Teacher -> Web : Review decision
Web -> API : POST review
API -> DB : Lock pending; write final review
DB -> API : Freeze support
API -> Web : Read-only history + evidence
@enduml
